/**
 * Same body as POST /v1/sales/invoices (IssueInvoiceRequest) and the same engine, rates, settings and checks, but no number, no stock change,
no customer quick-add, no audit. Use it for the live totals panel; on issue send expected_total = the preview's totals.net_payable.
Validation problems that would block the issue are 422 / 409 exactly as on issue, except the requirements (pan_required, cash limit,
discount / zero-GST / credit-sale / old-gold rate-override permission), which are reported in `requirements` and `warnings` instead of
failing, so the UI can prompt. making_service_rate_not_set is a 422 here too.
0.9.2 mode: invoice (default) | estimate. In estimate mode customer and salesperson are optional and the invoice-only checks (PAN,
cash limit, credit sale, balance due) are skipped or reported as warnings — the computation equals what POST /v1/sales/estimates stores.
No Idempotency-Key (no side effects). Requires sales.invoice.issue or sales.estimate.create.

 * @summary S1 running total: server-computed bill (lines, tax parts, totals, warnings and requirements) for an issue request — writes nothing
 */
